  "definition_cautions": [
    "Observed report timestamps are preserved as recorded (2026-10-24); the directory/task date is the client date 2026-10-25. No timestamp was shifted to match it.",
    "Batch application fingerprints describe only their completed live runs. Subsequent content-role edits, citation crawling, offline replay and future acquisition are excluded.",
    "raw_article_words counts whitespace-separated readable_text words for every ARTICLE_BODY in the retained acquisition pool, including rejected articles; it does not count every page/snippet or prove useful evidence.",
    "runner_summary_record_words describes retained report records and differs from all-acquired raw_article_words. Do not substitute it in baseline comparisons.",
    "qualified_sources and selected_excerpt_words are heuristic source-selection metrics; they are not independently verified facts, independent publishers or confirmed threats.",
    "published_workbench_words is the sum of words across deduplicated published passage texts, not a count of distinct vocabulary words or all previously inspectable frontend content.",
    "All five saved reports have exact matching source spans, UNVERIFIED passage claims and independence_verified=false. This validates capture fidelity, not assertion truth.",
    "DIRECTLY_RELEVANT labels concern selection for the objective. Historical/forecast financial context, unverified allegations and source-reported context remain distinct from claim confirmation.",
    "Scout includes 1240 historical and 2651 forecast-or-mixed-context published words in its 6248-word total.",
    "BrandShield stays SOURCE_REPORTS_ONLY, safety NOT_ESTABLISHED, threat_count=0 and safe_count=0 after the retest; warnings/allegations are not verified threats.",
    "Personal Watch retains one publisher-attributed 2021 public statement; identity_authenticated=false and identity_risk=UNASSESSED. Its saved workbench role is ARTICLE_CONTENT while the native public_statements projection uses PUBLIC_STATEMENT.",
    "Trending has one selected source and 322 published article words. A completed request and legacy safe_count=1 do not establish platform completeness, safety or a verified trend.",
    "Zero baseline denominators yield null ratios. Improvement from zero is newly observed yield, not a finite 20x gain.",
    "Fresh batches are descriptive observations with changing source availability and capture timing, not controlled causal before/after proof.",
    "Selected-excerpt to workbench ratios are not growth over all previously inspectable frontend text. Twentyfold useful-evidence acceptance remains NOT_DEMONSTRATED."
